a living in Arizona.</font>

403
00:16:29,812 --> 00:16:31,020
<font color="#FFFFFF">I will be a dancer.</font>

404
00:16:31,061 --> 00:16:32,395
<font color="#FFFFFF">What are your skills, Brian?</font>

405
00:16:34,520 --> 00:16:36,353
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, Steve.</font>

406
00:16:36,395 --> 00:16:38,478
<font color="#FFFFFF">We're not going to
Arizona to live together.</font>

407
00:16:38,520 --> 00:16:41,353
<font color="#FFFFFF">We're going there
to die together.</font>

408
00:16:41,395 --> 00:16:43,478
<font color="#FFFFFF">Uh… pardon me?</font>

409
00:16:43,520 --> 00:16:45,645
<font color="#FFFFFF">I've got nothing left
to live for, Steve.</font>

410
00:16:45,687 --> 00:16:48,770
<font color="#FFFFFF">Which is why I'm driving us
straight into the Grand Canyon.</font>

411
00:16:49,812 --> 00:16:51,895
<font color="#FFFFFF">Suicide, bitch!</font>

412
00:16:51,937 --> 00:16:53,520
<font color="#FFFFFF">Canyon style!</font>

413
00:16:56,854 --> 00:16:58,395
<font color="#FFFFFF">Tickets! Tickets!</font>

414
00:16:58,437 --> 00:16:59,520
<font color="#FFFFFF">Extra tickets.</font>

415
00:16:59,562 --> 00:17:01,687
<font color="#FFFFFF">This place is
totally screwing us.</font>

416
00:17:01,729 --> 00:17:04,562
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah, well, they're not the only
ones who can do the screwing.</font>

417
00:17:04,603 --> 00:17:05,895
<font color="#FFFFFF">I beg your pardon?</font>

418
00:17:05,937 --> 00:17:07,729
<font color="#FFFFFF">Their stupid water park
screws us,</font>

419
00:17:07,770 --> 00:17:11,270
<font color="#FFFFFF">we do the same thing…
to each other.</font>

420
00:17:11,311 --> 00:17:14,437
<font color="#FFFFFF">And we do it in there,
on the biggest slide they got.</font>

421
00:17:14,478 --> 00:17:16,520
<font color="#FFFFFF">Of course that's
what we do.</font>

422
00:17:16,562 --> 00:17:18,812
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's brilliant!</font>

423
00:17:18,854 --> 00:17:20,478
<font color="#FFFFFF">Dan?</font>

424
00:17:20,520 --> 00:17:22,478
<font color="#FFFFFF">Dan!</font>

425
00:17:22,520 --> 00:17:24,687
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't tell
my wife where I am.</font>

426
00:17:24,729 --> 00:17:29,687
<font color="#FFFFFF">She's the biggest bitch
in the universe!</font>

427
00:17:32,437 --> 00:17:33,854
<font color="#FFFFFF">Freddy, I can't
find Steve.</font>

428
00:17:33,895 --> 00:17:35,937
<font color="#FFFFFF">I haven't seen him
since you introduced us.</font>

429
00:17:35,979 --> 00:17:37,478
<font color="#FFFFFF">This is all your
fault, Frederick.</font>

430
00:17:37,520 --> 00:17:39,020
<font color="#FFFFFF">You were his
approved friend.</font>

431
00:17:39,061 --> 00:17:41,395
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're supposed to watch out
for him when I'm not around.</font>

432
00:17:41,437 --> 00:17:42,520
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're supposed to…</font>

433
00:17:45,270 --> 00:17:46,895
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't do that, man.</font>

434
00:17:46,937 --> 00:17:49,145
<font color="#FFFFFF">Look, Steve left
because you smother him.</font>

435
00:17:49,186 --> 00:17:52,061
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm a good kid because
my parents allow me the freedom</font>

436
00:17:52,103 --> 00:17:53,437
<font color="#FFFFFF">to be myself.</font>

437
00:17:53,478 --> 00:17:55,854
<font color="#FFFFFF">Can you imagine
how nervous they must have been</font>

438
00:17:55,895 --> 00:17:58,020
<font color="#FFFFFF">when I said
I was hanging out with you?</font>

439
00:17:58,061 --> 00:18:01,145
<font color="#FFFFFF">I suppose I am a dangerous,
aggressive stranger.</font>

440
00:18:01,186 --> 00:18:03,103
<font color="#FFFFFF">They let me make
my own mistakes,</font>

441
00:18:03,145 --> 00:18:05,854
<font color="#FFFFFF">but I know they're always there
when I need them.</font>

442
00:18:05,895 --> 00:18:08,687
<font color="#FFFFFF">Damn it, Freddy,
I've been a fool.</font>

443
00:18:08,729 --> 00:18:10,770
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's not enough
to love your kid.</font>

444
00:18:10,812 --> 00:18:12,979
<font color="#FFFFFF">You have to love him
the right way.</font>

445
00:18:13,020 --> 00:18:14,895
<font color="#FFFFFF">I know what I have to do.</font>

446
00:18:14,937 --> 00:18:17,020
<font color="#FFFFFF">I just hope I can
find Steve in time.</font>

447
00:18:17,061 --> 00:18:18,186
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well, I'm glad that…</font>

448
00:18:18,228 --> 00:18:20,687
<font color="#FFFFFF">Be glad about that.</font>

449
00:18:23,562 --> 00:18:24,770
<font color="#FFFFFF">Okay, here's the plan.</font>

450
00:18:24,812 --> 00:18:26,311
<font color="#FFFFFF">You go down first and wait</font>

451
00:18:26,353 --> 00:18:27,979
<font color="#FFFFFF">at the bottom
in a ready position.</font>

452
00:18:28,020 --> 00:18:29,812
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm gonna come down after you,
and by the time</font>

453
00:18:29,854 --> 00:18:31,687
<font color="#FFFFFF">I get to the bottom,
I'll be ready to go.</font>

454
00:18:31,729 --> 00:18:33,729
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll be there
to receive you.</font>

455
00:18:41,729 --> 00:18:43,603
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm coming in too hot!
Move back!</font>

456
00:18:43,645 --> 00:18:45,478
<font color="#FFFFFF">What?</font>

457
00:18:45,520 --> 00:18:46,520
<font color="#FFFFFF">Stan, slow down!</font>

458
00:18:53,145 --> 00:18:56,186
<font color="#FFFFFF">Brian, I don't want
to die in the Grand Canyon.</font>

459
00:18:56,228 --> 00:18:57,729
<font color="#FFFFFF">Please! I thought
we were friends.</font>

460
00:18:59,020 --> 00:19:00,353
<font color="#FFFFFF">You thought I let you</font>

461
00:19:00,395 --> 00:19:02,270
<font color="#FFFFFF">in the teacher's lounge
because I like you?</font>

462
00:19:02,311 --> 00:19:04,061
<font color="#FFFFFF">You were my
accountant, Steve.</font>

463
00:19:04,103 --> 00:19:05,979
<font color="#FFFFFF">Roger was right.</font>

464
00:19:06,020 --> 00:19:08,603
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ah, and there she is.</font>

465
00:19:17,186 --> 00:19:18,895
<font color="#FFFFFF">Roger!</font>

466
00:19:18,937 --> 00:19:20,895
<font color="#FFFFFF">You! How did you find us?</font>

467
00:19:20,937 --> 00:19:22,228
<font color="#FFFFFF">It was simple.</font>

468
00:19:22,270 --> 00:19:23,979
<font color="#FFFFFF">When you love someone
hard enough,</font>

469
00:19:24,020 --> 00:19:25,854
<font color="#FFFFFF">you always know where they are.</font>

470
00:19:25,895 --> 00:19:27,562
<font color="#FFFFFF">That can't
possibly be true.</font>

471
00:19:27,603 --> 00:19:29,186
<font color="#FFFFFF">Roger, thank God!</font>

472
00:19:29,228 --> 00:19:30,520
<font color="#FFFFFF">I want to go home!</font>

473
00:19:30,562 --> 00:19:31,979
<font color="#FFFFFF">I can't do that, Steve.</font>

474
00:19:32,020 --> 00:19:34,061
<font color="#FFFFFF">You see this gun
I'm pointing at you?</font>

475
00:19:34,103 --> 00:19:35,937
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's what I've been doing
this whole week…</font>

476
00:19:35,979 --> 00:19:37,437
<font color="#FFFFFF">holding you hostage.</font>

477
00:19:37,478 --> 00:19:39,061
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well, not anymore.</font>

478
00:19:39,103 --> 00:19:40,729
<font color="#FFFFFF">What? No!</font>

479
00:19:40,770 --> 00:19:43,186
<font color="#FFFFFF">Principal Lewis is gonna
drive off the Grand Canyon!</font>

480
00:19:43,228 --> 00:19:45,020
<font color="#FFFFFF">You'll be fine, Steve.</font>

481
00:19:45,061 --> 00:19:47,520
<font color="#FFFFFF">I came here to tell you,
you'll be fine.</font>

482
00:19:47,562 --> 00:19:49,854
<font color="#FFFFFF">And I'll be supporting you
all the way.</font>

483
00:19:49,895 --> 00:19:51,311
<font color="#FFFFFF">Shoot Principal Lewis now!</font>

484
00:19:51,353 --> 00:19:53,437
<font color="#FFFFFF">I love you
way too much for that.</font>

485
00:19:53,478 --> 00:19:54,603
<font color="#FFFFFF">See ya, sucker!</font>

486
00:19:56,437 --> 00:19:58,562
<font color="#FFFFFF">Good-bye, bad credit!</font>

487
00:19:58,603 --> 00:20:00,270
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, my God!</font>

488
00:20:03,854 --> 00:20:05,061
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't believe it.</font>

489
00:20:05,103 --> 00:20:07,437
<font color="#FFFFFF">Roger's love
is keeping us aloft.</font>

490
00:20:09,061 --> 00:20:10,687
<font color="#FFFFFF">We're gonna make it.</font>

491
00:20:10,729 --> 00:20:12,478
<font color="#FFFFFF">So long, junk mail!</font>

492
00:20:12,520 --> 00:20:13,979
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wait. What?</font>

493
00:20:20,895 --> 00:20:22,687
<font color="#FFFFFF">Steve, I'm so sorry.</font>

494
00:20:22,729 --> 00:20:24,645
<font color="#FFFFFF">I never meant
for you to get hurt.</font>

495
00:20:24,687 --> 00:20:26,395
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm a terrible
legal guardian.</font>

496
00:20:26,437 --> 00:20:28,520
<font color="#FFFFFF">You are the worst
legal guardian.</font>

497
00:20:28,562 --> 00:20:30,311
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm sorry, too, Steve.</font>

498
00:20:30,353 --> 00:20:32,353
<font color="#FFFFFF">Surviving that crash
made me realize,</font>

499
00:20:32,395 --> 00:20:35,603
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm on this Earth for a reason…
to shape young minds.</font>

500
00:20:35,645 --> 00:20:38,395
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm gonna get my job back
as principal,</font>

501
00:20:38,437 --> 00:20:40,979
<font color="#FFFFFF">and this time,
I'm gonna do everything right.</font>

502
00:20:41,020 --> 00:20:42,895
<font color="#FFFFFF">Time for your
bath, Mr. Lewis?</font>

503
00:20:42,937 --> 00:20:44,478
<font color="#FFFFFF">Please.</font>

504
00:20:44,520 --> 00:20:46,353
<font color="#FFFFFF">Mr. Lewis was
my father.</font>

505
00:20:46,395 --> 00:20:49,395
<font color="#FFFFFF">Call me Chocolate Dinosaur.</font>

506
00:20:50,562 --> 00:20:52,270
<font color="#FFFFFF">Dad! Mom!</font>

507
00:20:52,311 --> 00:20:54,395
<font color="#FFFFFF">Steve! Roger!</font>

508
00:20:54,437 --> 00:20:55,937
<font color="#FFFFFF">What the hell is going on?</font>

509
00:20:55,979 --> 00:20:57,520
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well, it looks
like you tried</font>

510
00:20:57,562 --> 00:20:59,103
<font color="#FFFFFF">to slingshot yourself
into Francine.</font>

511
00:20:59,145 --> 00:21:00,228
<font color="#FFFFFF">Didn't you, Stan?</font>

512
00:21:00,270 --> 00:21:02,478
<font color="#FFFFFF">I came in too hot.</font>

513
00:21:02,520 --> 00:21:04,478
<font color="#FFFFFF">This is the worst
day of my life.</font>

514
00:21:04,520 --> 00:21:06,353
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well, you're not getting
your morphine back.</font>

515
00:21:06,395 --> 00:21:07,687
<font color="#FFFFFF">Roger, give
it back!</font>

516
00:21:07,729 --> 00:21:08,979
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't be
such a jerk!</font>

517
00:21:09,020 --> 00:21:10,186
<font color="#FFFFFF">God, I'm sick of you!</font>

518
00:21:10,228 --> 00:21:11,562
<font color="#FFFFFF">Come on!
Give it!
Freddy!</font>

519
00:21:11,603 --> 00:21:13,228
<font color="#FFFFFF">Damn it, Roger,
come on!</font>

520
00:21:16,145 --> 00:21:18,270
<font color="#FFFFFF">Freddy.</font>

521
00:21:50,854 --> 00:21:52,854
<font color="#FFFFFF">Bye! Have a beautiful time.</font>

522
00:21:53,854 --> 00:21:54,854
<font color="#FFFFFF">Captioned by Point.360</font>

